  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release\n            - Complete IFileStorage implementation for Azure Blob Storage\n            - SAS token generation for signed URLs\n            - Access tier support (Hot, Cool, Archive)\n            - Public blob access support\n            - Thumbnail generation and caching in blobs\n            - Blob metadata for file information\n            - Advanced search and pagination",
